Third-party notices

This project is an unofficial mod for HELLDIVERS (© Sony Interactive Entertainment /
Arrowhead Game Studios). It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the rights holders.

The MIT license above covers the code in this repository only. It does not cover the game
or anything derived from it:

- The release archives ship a patched copy of the game's boot package
  (`resource_packages/boot`). That data remains the property of the rights holders and is
  meant to be used only with a legitimately owned copy of the game.
- `vendor/base_csm.lua` is a decompiled game script. It is not part of this repository; it
  is generated locally from the user's own installation with `tools/extract_base.py`.
- The QoL mod is the work of its author. This patch only hooks it at runtime and
  redistributes nothing from it.
